  "content": "<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支援我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Patreon上支援我\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入我們的Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支援我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支援我\"></a></h1><h1>樹木砍伐者</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p><p>一個Minecraft資料包，當你<strong>蹲下時用斧頭破壞原木</strong>，會自動砍倒整棵樹。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1356258/description_fee850f2-e7d4-4760-81b3-acfbe5a851d3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p><h2>備註</h2><ul>\n<li>樹木砍伐者僅在蹲下（潛行）時啟動</li>\n<li>若只想破壞一個方塊，請在未蹲下時正常破壞原木</li>\n<li>樹葉會掉落正常物品（樹苗、樹枝），如同手動破壞一樣</li>\n<li>使用之間有短暫冷卻時間，以避免效能問題</li>\n</ul>",
